commit 1ebdebf4cacc04fcb83191053b4e979cbcdcb2d6), Copyright IBM Corporation, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The documents in docs/ and the evidence in logs/public/ quote short
excerpts and command output of that project for the purpose of documenting the reproduction.

The upstream sources, the Linux kernel, QEMU, OpenSBI, Buildroot, and the other software built
during the reproduction are not included in this repository; they are obtained from their
original locations, as recorded in docs/SOURCE_PROVENANCE.md, under their own licenses.
